### ==============================================================================
### NexusFin AI - Live API Testing Suite (Click 'Send Request' above each endpoint)
### ==============================================================================

### 1. Eureka Service Discovery Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8761

### 2. API Gateway Health Check & Correlation ID
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 3. Swagger UI Documentation (Ledger Service)
GET http://localhost:8081/swagger-ui.html

### 4. Create an Operating Reserve Account (Asset Account)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "ACC-ASSET-001",
  "accountName": "Operating Reserve",
  "accountType": "ASSET",
  "currency": "USD",
  "initialBalance": 5000.00
}

### 5. Create a Customer Wallet Account (Liability Account)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountNumber": "ACC-LIAB-001",
  "accountName": "Customer Wallet",
  "accountType": "LIABILITY",
  "currency": "USD",
  "initialBalance": 1000.00
}

### 6. Execute Balanced Double-Entry Transfer (Debits == Credits)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/ledger/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountNumber": "ACC-ASSET-001",
  "destinationAccountNumber": "ACC-LIAB-001",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "idempotencyKey": "KEY-DEMO-001",
  "transactionReference": "TX-DEMO-001",
  "description": "Customer account funding transfer"
}

### 7. Inspect Account Balance After Transfer
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts/number/ACC-ASSET-001

### 8. Test AI Fraud Detection Pipeline (Normal Low-Risk Transaction)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/fraud/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionReference": "TX-SAFE-001",
  "accountNumber": "ACC-ASSET-001",
  "amount": 45.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "description": "Routine retail coffee purchase",
  "clientIp": "192.168.1.100"
}

### 9. Test AI Fraud Detection Pipeline (Suspicious Critical High-Value Transfer)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/fraud/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transactionReference": "TX-SUSPICIOUS-001",
  "accountNumber": "ACC-ASSET-001",
  "amount": 2500000.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "description": "High-value offshore wire",
  "clientIp": "10.0.0.1"
}

### 10. Test Gateway Circuit Breaker Fallback Endpoint Directly
GET http://localhost:8080/fallback/ledger

